sequenceDiagram
    title Logical sequence - Officer updates status (PATCH /incidents/42)
    participant WebDashboard
    participant AuthMiddleware
    participant IncidentRouter
    participant Repository
    participant DBTriggers
    participant Outbox
    participant Worker
    WebDashboard->>AuthMiddleware: PATCH status assigned, team, officer, note
    AuthMiddleware->>IncidentRouter: staffOnly passed
    IncidentRouter->>Repository: withTx, SELECT incident FOR UPDATE
    IncidentRouter->>Repository: team implies department, set status note
    Repository->>DBTriggers: UPDATE incidents
    DBTriggers->>DBTriggers: check incident_status_transitions for role
    DBTriggers->>DBTriggers: stamp assigned_at, write status history
    DBTriggers->>DBTriggers: write assignment history and audit log
    DBTriggers-->>Repository: row updated or 422 rule violation
    Repository->>Repository: UPDATE ai_predictions decision if overridden
    Repository->>Outbox: create_notification to reporter and officer
    Repository-->>WebDashboard: 200 updated incident detail
    Worker->>Outbox: every 10 s claim queued deliveries SKIP LOCKED
    Outbox-->>Worker: email rows
    Worker->>Worker: send via SMTP, retry with backoff
